{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/f9817c32b06f0e3266608b630955250b.poster.avif?t=1765389109\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/f9817c32b06f0e3266608b630955250b.webm?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/f9817c32b06f0e3266608b630955250b.mp4?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010\u2605Introduction\u2605\u3011 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Escape \u00d7 Romance \u00d7 Training \u2014 Embark on a unique, heartfelt journey with an elven maiden!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WA-TA! You're a badass ninja. And, as fate would have it, your latest mission is to save an elven maiden that's been imprisoned, Lizet. But the world is a dangerous place, so to ensure her survival, you decide to train her in the ways of ninjutsu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you flee from the kingdom and train her as your disciple, your relationship with her begins to quietly change...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as an honest relationship between master and disciple has slowly grown into something deeper. As you and Lizet interact on a regular basis, and spend more time together, perhaps...something might happen that will make both of your hearts race?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adult simulation game that features character cultivation, daily interactions, and optional intimate moments. Get ready for an exciting romantic comedy that takes place while living on the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010\u2605Game Features\u2605\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Full Japanese voice acting for female characters to enhance their charm and make the experience fully immersive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Full 3D cartoon rendering that makes for super duper sensory overload!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 360\u00b0 camera control for the intimate scenes. Check out every single detail of her body and movements! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Over 29 animated intimate scenes~\u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 3 different endings! You choose how the future unfolds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010\u2605Main Characters\u2605\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Lizet | Elven Girl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/f8f7bd5688dbde1d1569240a238fba7c.poster.avif?t=1765389109\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/f8f7bd5688dbde1d1569240a238fba7c.webm?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/f8f7bd5688dbde1d1569240a238fba7c.mp4?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elven maiden who longs for the outside world and sets off in search of freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as she gets a whiff of what she so desires, some no-good, ill-intended humans capture her! Luckily, you show up just in time to save her...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you two flee for your lives, you teach her how to fight and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bond between you grows, and so does Lizet's free spirit. As time passes, she finds herself becoming attracted to her master...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude84Sylva | Witch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/cb4f5380637e6145c47dd260442680cf.poster.avif?t=1765389109\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/cb4f5380637e6145c47dd260442680cf.webm?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/cb4f5380637e6145c47dd260442680cf.mp4?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A witch skilled in dimensional magic, who is as old as she is mysterious...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silva has been working with you for quite some time, though it's unclear whether she's here to help you with this journey...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 Ayla | Priestess</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/295d2b216d724dcd4261d17a358de3f2.poster.avif?t=1765389109\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/295d2b216d724dcd4261d17a358de3f2.webm?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/295d2b216d724dcd4261d17a358de3f2.mp4?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A member of your former adventuring party, and a highly skilled priestess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At one point in time, she was actively pursuing you as a romantic partner. However, her...unique personality made it difficult for you to feel the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yet fate has deemed it fit for you two to meet again, albeit in a rather unusual way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830690?t=1765389109","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830690?t=1765389109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/b89bcad65c28c80de3eabc8878610b6899088bf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765389109","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/b89bcad65c28c80de3eabc8878610b6899088bf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765389109","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters depicted are over the age of 20.\r\nContent Warning!\r\nThis game depicts: Sex Acts, Bondage, Exhibitionism, Anal Sex, Footjobs, Blowjobs."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/f9817c32b06f0e3266608b630955250b.poster.avif?t=1765389109\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/f9817c32b06f0e3266608b630955250b.webm?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/f9817c32b06f0e3266608b630955250b.mp4?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010\u2605Introduction\u2605\u3011 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Escape \u00d7 Romance \u00d7 Training \u2014 Embark on a unique, heartfelt journey with an elven maiden!</p><p class=\"bb_par