ther she's here to help you with this journey...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 Ayla | Priestess</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/295d2b216d724dcd4261d17a358de3f2.poster.avif?t=1765389109\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/295d2b216d724dcd4261d17a358de3f2.webm?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/extras/295d2b216d724dcd4261d17a358de3f2.mp4?t=1765389109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A member of your former adventuring party, and a highly skilled priestess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At one point in time, she was actively pursuing you as a romantic partner. However, her...unique personality made it difficult for you to feel the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yet fate has deemed it fit for you two to meet again, albeit in a rather unusual way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Barance Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830690/76dd944a696406c6131ebe9b96384185b86b0e5f/header.jpg?t=1765389109","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830690/496759446/07776e78b24aab6997b9bdcd93425da781262930/1757662334/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757666636","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830690/496759446/07776e78b24aab6997b9bdcd93425da781262930/1757662334/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757666636","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.